{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a 2D action RPG where you explore the metropolis of Dicefall and let the roll of the dice decide victory or defeat. Craft powerful dice, upgrade your abilities, make crucial decisions, and survive the city\u2019s political power struggles to find your missing brother.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DICE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/0c50677c9a2353a1d70e3ccf3ee99053.poster.avif?t=1760000567\" width=1170 height=329 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/0c50677c9a2353a1d70e3ccf3ee99053.webm?t=1760000567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dicefall, dice determine your fate. Consider strategies to use them most effectively. But beware: rolling the dice also involves risk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BECOME MORE POWERFUL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/1e2ce7d2c64c55825be06364e2b2ac30.poster.avif?t=1760000567\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/1e2ce7d2c64c55825be06364e2b2ac30.webm?t=1760000567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/1e2ce7d2c64c55825be06364e2b2ac30.mp4?t=1760000567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your abilities and customize your dice! Create unique builds for your own playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE PROBLEMS YOUR WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/0210d0b9d530703a8b1087b6e61a7a08.poster.avif?t=1760000567\" width=1170 height=329 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/0210d0b9d530703a8b1087b6e61a7a08.webm?t=1760000567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your words, pull some strings, lie, or throw some punches. You decide.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SAVE YOUR SPOT!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/extras/75aeab36895942dbfea5bb0989f53a8e.avif?t=1760000567\" width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dicefall is currently in the alpha phase. Help shape the future of the game and be one of the first to play!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3888300?t=1760000567","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/886ad6f96b41ec9e161295d35be224a2a0b0c2c4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760000567","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/8d9491729872bd43e1cbb7bb6b189380d1698e53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760000567","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3888300/8d9491729872bd43e1cbb7bb6b189380d1698e53/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760000567","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_i